<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean forex market closed for public holiday.</title>
<headline>S.Korean forex market closed for public holiday.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The won/dollar market was closed on Friday for a national holiday on Memorial Day and will reopen on Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The won ended on Thursday at 890.50 to the dollar, compared with Wednesday's close of 890.90.</p>
<p>Monday's mid-rate was estimated to be pegged at 890.90 against 891.00 on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Yeom Yoon-jeong (822) 727 5647</p>
